{
 "version": 1,
 "description": "Declared mutants of SDL line sub-batch I, the image Module (docs/architecture/target/v2/image.zh-Hant.md; ids im- the loader and the pixel layout, ib- build-time link checks). One per independently wrong decision of Design Invariants IM-1 to IM-4 (tests/common/mutation/README.md, criteria 1 to 3 and 9). Not added (with the reason): the signature length check and the header length check (removing either reads past the end, undefined behaviour); requesting fewer than 4 channels from stb_image (the copy then reads past stb's buffer, undefined behaviour); the order of rules 3 and 4 (structural: rule 3 returns before the decoder is called, shown by the TooLarge cases without image data); the conversions inside stb_image (rule 4's conversions are stb_image's code, guarded by the colour type cases, not by mutants of a third-party file).",
